-Thank you. Yeah, folks.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.402 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:35.402 --> 00:00:38.738 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Folks.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:41.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
There is this annoying trend
