on hemorrhoids.com."

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.225 size:75% position:38%
I don't want to know
Bob's story, okay?

00:00:59.225 --> 00:00:59.759 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.695
How empty is my life that I have
time to go to this website?

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, if I want to see
hemorrhoids,

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.300
I can stand in the bathroom
with a hand mirror, okay?

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.669 size:78% position:39%
