up your ass, okay?

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:32.258
That's all I have to say.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:32.992 size:84% position:42% line:92%
No, oh, no, no, no, no.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:37.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
